## Notes

{% aside type="note" title="Notes" %}
- Product quantization is exposed as a fixed `x4` compression option in this release.
- Collection-level HNSW configuration is still not exposed through `CREATE COLLECTION`.
- Query-time tuning remains separate: use `EXACT` or `WITH { hnsw_ef: <n>, exact: true|false, acorn: true|false }`.
{% /aside %}

